    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/3ecd5390aba29435aa22e3293d74ff1c.webp?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000Slime has to work...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a79f05936a411314f638b1e32b87e020.avif?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/ae578d1f9de48cbcc92448c42eb7fa28.webp?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000Slime needs power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/cd02236b12232c19f2b6e906d6e7dd6b.avif?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/54d768cc2bef7cb419cc1a1ddaa91089.webp?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000Weak, weak slime...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/e3cc29827f8eb598aa9918cb95adbaa6.avif?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/c2bc61333ce47fd2219221940e7bc67b.webp?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 But the bravest slime.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/380723ed55e3ac3ef2cb35c0616f310b.avif?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f817fd004a7ae2f3916ded6203a6f1f.webp?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000One country slime.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/b1d236897356046398515e194f406e37.avif?t=1748019356\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Survive one more day!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Soothe hunger and quench thirst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Melt the cold body and be careful not to break the spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Everything around the tiny slime is designed to help it survive just a bit longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Obtain equipment and skills in the cave, and upgrade them to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The master of the deepest part of the cave gradually withers crops and makes animals disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat it, and the slime\u2019s journey continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- But masters will always try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The cave changes at random when a master is defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>If it's tough, you can fight with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Team up with friends who are on the same day as you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can group up with up to three friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use various support skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Your friend can be a tank, and you can be a support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you fall when your sanity is at its lowest, the journey of the slime will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>But your longest journey will be recorded.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3000</i></p>",
